    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "08. Command Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "08.00",
    "summary": "Both players gain their Core CP. You then assess how ready your forces are for combat, and may use any of your abilities that work in the Command phase. The phase has five steps, from Start of Command Phase to End of Command Phase.",
